MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_001: Promised One! I'm happy to report good news. Not a\nsingle person died in that town you sent me to.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_002: <NCA>"All thanks to you. Well done."
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_003: <NCB>"Our plan worked."
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_004: Heh, well...I should probably mention that the\ntown had been evacuated by the time we got there.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_005: But I bet you already knew that. I've got to say, I\ncan't read you that well. Are you messing with me?
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_006: Not that I'm a guy who doesn't mind fudging the\ndetails for the sake of a good story. Hehe.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_007: <NCA>"You seem to be enjoying yourself."
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_008: You get me. Gotta keep things interesting!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_009: Life should be interesting. If not, I add a little spice.\nThat rub some people the wrong way? Sure.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_010: I figure if I'm having a good time, so are they!\nBesides, what's a lie anyway...
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_011: but a truth just waiting to happen! Ahahaha!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_012: <NCA>"Hmm. I'm not sure about that..."
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_013: <NCB>"Well, OK... But you are toying with people."
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_014: Hang on... You and me, we're pretty much the same!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_015: <ACA>I mean, Promised One, what you promised hasn't\nhappened. World hasn't been saved—not yet.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_016: <ACB>I mean, Promised One... You're just one person who's\ngotten lots of people to believe in what you're doing.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_017: So, hey! We'd both better step up here. If we don't\nwin, that WILL make liars out of us. Bad form!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_018: Tsk...
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_019: Oh, cheer up. I know you can do it!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_020: It's you and me—together to the end. I just need you\nto believe in yourself more.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_021: You know, big talkers like us make the world go\nround. C'mon—let's go SAVE that world!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_A_022: Haha! See? This is gonna be fun. Let's go crush that\nevil god who thinks we're full of crap.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_001: Well, Unkillable Guzran lives and the Promised\nOne who saved the world... *sigh*
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_002: What you did was truly great. Dying on the other\nhand? Well, at least you made it interesting.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_003: I'd hate to waste an epic ending. How's this sound?\nGuzran—the One, the Only...World Saver!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_004: Huh?! You're alive? Hahaha! That was a cruel joke.\nMore cruel than all my lies put together!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_005: <NCA>"The One and Only?"
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_006: <NCB>"That lie went way too far."
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_007: <ACA>Oh, haha, you heard that, did you? I was just\nmessing around the way we do.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_008: <ACB>Oh, you heard that, did you? Haha! Glad to know\nyour impeccable hearing survived as well.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_009: Mm...
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_010: Don't take this the wrong way, but I almost feel bad\nfor that Balor guy. He had it pretty tough.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_011: Kind of unlucky, you know? Not only was he facing\nthe Promised One, who fought him to the bitter end...
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_012: but he also went up against an unkillable mercenary.\nThe god of the underworld never stood a chance.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_013: So, anyway... What's next for you?
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_014: Now that you've officially saved the world are you\ngonna retire?
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_015: <NCA>"There's still more to do."
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_016: Haha! Of course, of course. You saved everyone. 
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_017: But as long as the world keeps going round, you'll\nalways have more to do, huh?
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_018: That's pretty much how I feel too.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_019: <RSDS>The Unkillable Guzran's got a whole lot more\nliving to do!
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_020: Oh, it's gonna be epic, I promise you that.
MID_SE_Ism_Guj_S_021: Next time you need my help, you just come my\nway, OK? Always glad to spice things up.